OL,3,GNEWSAThames Water reports seven-borough
OL,4,Awater outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FHomes across five south London boroughs
OL,7,Fand two Surrey boroughs may have no
OL,8,Fwater or low pressure due to a large
OL,9,Fburst water main, Thames Water has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FThe company said the issue was
OL,13,Faffecting customers in postcode areas
OL,14,Facross Kingston upon Thames, Merton,
OL,15,FRichmond upon Thames, Sutton and
OL,16,FWandsworth in London, as well as
OL,17,FElmbridge and Spelthorne in Surrey.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
