OL,3,GNEWSAThames Water reports seven-borough
OL,4,Awater outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Thames Water spokesperson apologised
OL,7,Ffor the lack of water, adding: "Our
OL,8,Fspecialist team is now on site and
OL,9,Fworking to stop the water flooding from
OL,10,Fthe broken pipe."
OL,12,FThe organisation said the following
OL,13,Fpostcodes may be affected: CR4, KT1,
OL,14,FKT10, KT12, KT2, KT3, KT5, KT6, KT7,
OL,15,FKT8, SM4, SW16, SW17, SW18, SW19, SW20,
OL,16,FTW10, TW16.
